 "description": "Enjoy the teaser for OVERGROWN, a potential feature film project by Blender Studio. More information is available at https://studio.blender.org/projects/overgrown/ \r\n\r\nTo ensure a stable foundation for this project, we are looking for the support of 7,000 people and invite more subscribers to join: together we can make OVERGROWN happen. Community support multiplies what we can achieve and share back. Free and open source, for everyone.\r\n\r\nJoin Blender Studio today with 20% OFF for your subscription: https://studio.blender.org/join/plan-variation/1/?coupon_code=OPEN20\r\n\r\nFollow Blender Studio:\r\n* Bluesky: https://bsky.app/profile/studio.blender.org\r\n* Mastodon: https://mastodon.social/@BlenderStudio\r\n* Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/blender.studio.official/\r\n* LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/blender-studio-official/\r\n* Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BlenderStudioOfficial/\r\n* X: https://x.com/BlenderStudio_\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\n#BlenderStudio #b3d",
